"sunnypilot 縱向控制是該車輛上的默認縱向控制。"

msgid "sunnypilot Unavailable"
msgstr "無法使用 sunnypilot"

msgid ""
"sunnypilot defaults to driving in chill mode. Experimental mode enables "
"alpha-level features that aren't ready for chill mode. Experimental features"
" are listed below:<br><h4>End-to-End Longitudinal Control</h4><br>Let the "
"driving model control the gas and brakes. sunnypilot will drive as it thinks"
" a human would, including stopping for red lights and stop signs. Since the "
"driving model decides the speed to drive, the set speed will only act as an "
"upper bound. This is an alpha quality feature; mistakes should be "
"expected.<br><h4>New Driving Visualization</h4><br>The driving visualization"
" will transition to the road-facing wide-angle camera at low speeds to "
"better show some turns. The Experimental mode logo will also be shown in the"
" top right corner."
msgstr ""
"sunnypilot默認以舒適模式駕駛。實驗模式啟用尚未準備好"
" 進入舒適模式的alpha級功能。實驗功能如下所示： "
"<br><h4>端到端縱向控制</h4><br>讓駕駛模型控制油門和剎車。 "
"sunnypilot將按照人類的駕駛方式來行駛，包括在紅燈和停車標誌前停車。 "
"由於駕駛模型決定行駛速度，設定速度僅作為上限。 "
"這是一個alpha質量的功能；應預期會出現錯誤。"
" <br><h4>新的駕駛可視化</h4><br>駕駛可視化 "
"將在低速時切換到面向道路的廣角攝像頭，"
" 以更好地顯示某些轉彎。實驗模式標識也將顯示在右上角。"

msgid ""
"sunnypilot is continuously calibrating, resetting is rarely required. "
"Resetting calibration will restart sunnypilot if the car is powered on."
msgstr ""
"sunnypilot 會持續進行校準，因此很少需要重置。 "
"如果車輛電源已開啟，重置校準需要重新啟動 sunnypilot"

msgid ""
"sunnypilot learns to drive by watching humans, like you, drive.\n"
"\n"
"Firehose Mode allows you to maximize your training data uploads to improve openpilot's driving models. More data means bigger models, which means better Experimental Mode."
msgstr ""
"sunnypilot通過觀察人類（比如您）駕駛來學習駕駛。\n"
"\n"
"訓練數據上傳模式 可讓您最大化訓練數據的上傳量，以提升openpilot的駕駛模型性能。"
"數據越多，模型越大，實驗模式的性能也就越好。"

msgid "sunnypilot longitudinal control may come in a future update."
msgstr ""
